   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Priya. Your identity is verified.\n\nI found order 5103 from Green Bowl, delivered on October 24 at 6:31 PM. The tofu wrap is listed as a missing item, and it was one wrap at $11.25. For a missing item, you can choose one of two options:\n\n1. **Refund of $11.25** to your original payment method (Visa ending in 4242).\n2. **Account credit of $13.50**, which is the item price plus 20%, for use on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, Priya. Okay, so the wrap is $11.25 and the credit option is $13.50? Before I pick, I should mention that the lemonades were also missing. I ordered two of them, and they didn't come either."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, I can add that. The lemonades are listed as 2 items at $4.00 each. Missing items are handled per item, so you can choose a different option for each one:\n\n- **Tofu wrap (1):** refund of $11.25, or account credit of $13.50\n- **Lemonade (2):** refund of $8.00, or account credit of $9.60\n\nYour options for the two items together are:\n- Refund both to your Visa ending in 4242: $19.25\n- Credit both to your account: $23.10\n- A mix, such as a refund for one item and credit for the other\n\nWhich option would you like for each item?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I'd like account credit for both. I order from Forkful almost every week, so credit is more useful to me than a refund to my card. So that's $23.10 in credit total, right?"
  },
