   "text": "Yes, that's correct: $13.50 for the tofu wrap plus $9.60 for the two lemonades, for a total of $23.10 in account credit. I'll apply both now.\n\nI've added $23.10 in account credit to your Forkful account. Your credit balance is now $23.10, and it's ready to use on your next order.\n\n- Tofu wrap: $13.50\n- Lemonades (2): $9.60\n\nSorry the wrap and lemonades didn't arrive. Is there anything else I can help you with?"
